graph LR
    Feast["Feast<br/>operator + feature server"]

    %% External build/runtime dependencies
    Feast -->|operator framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    Feast -->|k8s client| ClientGo["client-go v0.35.4"]
    Feast -->|Route, TLS profile types| OSAPI["openshift/api"]
    Feast -->|TLS profile watcher| CRC["openshift/controller-runtime-common"]
    Feast -->|platform detection| PlatUtil["odh-platform-utilities v0.5.0"]
    Feast -->|ServiceMonitor| PromOp["prometheus-operator client v0.83.0"]
    Feast -->|SDK and servers| FeastSDK["feast[minimal] 0.67.0<br/>Python 3.12"]
    FeastSDK -->|HTTP| FastAPI["fastapi 0.139.2 / uvicorn / gunicorn"]
    FeastSDK -->|registry gRPC| GRPC["grpcio 1.83.0"]
    FeastSDK -->|Arrow Flight| PyArrow["pyarrow 20.0.0"]
    FeastSDK -->|MCP| MCPlib["mcp 1.29.1 / fastmcp 3.4.8"]
    FeastSDK -->|JWT / TLS| Crypto["pyjwt 2.15.1 / cryptography 50.0.0"]
    Feast -->|CronJob kubectl| OseCli["ose-cli-rhel9"]
    Feast -.->|data-registry sidecar| KRP["odh-kube-rbac-proxy"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    RHODS["RHOAI platform operator"] -->|deploys, injects images| Feast
    Feast -->|watches Notebooks| Notebooks["Kubeflow Notebooks / Workbenches"]
    Dashboard["RHOAI Dashboard"] -->|registry REST, data-registry| Feast
    Feast -->|discovers tracking URI| MLflow["MLflow operator"]
    Feast -->|serves API group| DataReg["Data Registry<br/>dataregistry.opendatahub.io"]
    Feast -.->|SparkApplications| Spark["Spark Operator"]
    Feast -.->|compute engine| Ray["KubeRay / CodeFlare"]
    Feast -->|serving certs| SCA["OpenShift service CA"]
    Feast -->|UI Route| Router["OpenShift Router"]
    Feast -->|ServiceMonitor| Prom["Prometheus / UWM"]
    Feast -->|install detection| OLM["OLM"]
    Feast -->|CA trust| TrustCA["odh-trusted-ca-bundle"]

    %% External services
    Feast -->|API server 6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    Feast -.->|online/registry stores| DBs["PostgreSQL / Redis / Valkey /<br/>Cassandra / Snowflake / Milvus"]
    Feast -.->|registry/offline data| ObjStore["S3 / GCS"]
    Feast -.->|JWKS| OIDC["OIDC provider"]
    Feast -.->|lineage events| OpenLineage["OpenLineage endpoint"]
    Feast -.->|feature repo clone| Git["Git"]

